 o Motif Window Manager (mwm) 
 o Shared Motif widget Library (libXm.so.2.0 and libXm.so) 
 o Motif Demos 
 o Static Motif Widget Library (limXm.a)
 o Static Mrm UIL Libraries 
 o UIL Compiler 
 o Motif Header Files 
 o Manual Pages for Motif Function Calls 
 o Imakefile Support 
 o Source to OSF/Motif Demos 
 o Over 400 quality color pixmaps, most with transparent backgrounds 
 o Pixmap Editor 
 o Xbmbrowser Utility 

Also includes the KL Group Professional Developer's Suite containing:

 o XRT/3d: Stunning, informative and dynamic 3D charts and graphs
 o XRT/field: Data-entry fields, without tedious XmText validation code
 o XRT/gear: the basic component collection (tab, outliner/tree, progress,
   tips, printing, icons, and much more)
