This mailing list has been created as a forum for the exchange of 
information relating specifically to the use of the products of Cyclades
Corporation.

To subscribe to cyclades-users, send email to majordomo@lists.fdt.net 
with a message consisting of

        subscribe cyclades-users [your-email-address]

Similarly, to unsubscribe, send email to majordomo@lists.fdt.net with
a message consisting of

        unsubscribe cyclades-users [your-email-address]

A digested version of this list is available as well.  Just substitute
cyclades-users-digest in the lines above and you should be all set.

The address for posting messages to the entire group is

        cyclades-users@lists.fdt.net

Sending mail to this address will automatically forward your message
to everyone on the Cyclades Users Mailing List.  Posting to the list
was going to be restricted to list members only, but is now open, and will 
remain so unless spam becomes a problem.

The Cyclades Users Mailing List is primarily intended to be a discussion
group for people using or planning to use any of products sold by Cyclades
Corporation.  This currently includes primarily multi-port serial cards and
routers.

If you have any problems, comments or queries, please send email to
cyclades-users-owner@lists.fdt.net.



