I'm proud to announce that WZCE 2.31N (N for non-commercial) has been
uploaded to sunsite.unc.edu and ccic.ifcss.org. It should soon be placed
under
	http://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/apps/chinese or
	ftp://ccic.ifcss.org/pub/software/linux/tty

For those who don't know what WZCE is, WZCE stands for Wei Zhong
Chinese Environment, which is a software package to support Chinese
