I have released dhcpcd-0.65. This release makes dhcpcd work with the
DHCP servers which expect DHCP clients' UDP source port number to be
68 (DHCP client port). Try dhcpcd-0.65 if you cannot get an IP address
from the server and get the message "NO DHCPOFFER messages". The
attached is the lsm file.


