This clock uses Motif widgets to display the time and date.  If you
don't have the Motif libs, you can run the statically linked 
version which is included.  A menu allows you to select any timezone
you want displayed.  I have found it to be very handy at work and
in the ham shack.

- -------------
Some Features
- -------------

Besides displaying the time (with scale widgets) and the date,
another label is included where you can display your call, your name.....

No need to recompile.  A resource file allows you to easily specify
things like fonts, colors, default timezone, and geometry.

A menu allows you to select the time you want to display.  Choose 
from local, GMT, or from dozens of cities around the world. 


