-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----


I just released kbd-0.94 to get rid of a lot of patches
in my mailbox.  Nothing very new or interesting -
get it only if you want to test it.

Loadkeys now recognizes the keyword `alt_is_meta'.
For many keymaps this probably means that all
key definitions containing the substring `Meta_' become superfluous.
(Also, that Meta is handled in a more systematic way.)
New versions of national keymaps using this are welcome.

