xdemo2 - demo for X11

xdemo2 is a demo, like Scene demos for X11.
It's a play with a word Linux.
xdemo2 works with 320x240 and 640x480 points X11 window in 8bpp and 
uses the shared memory extension from X11. It plays music, too.

It contains the following effects:
  - spot lights (over the engraved Linux text)
  - fire (hot linux :-) )
  - tunnel (3d walking)
  - plasma (read plasmics funny texts)
  - stars with running text (like in the film Star Wars)
  - glow (hip hop glow)

