message that you received, and put "REMOVE" or "UNSUBSCRIBE" in the 
subject line.  Including at least the header of the message that you got from 
us ensures that we can remove the right address from our files. Without the 
original address, often email forwarding will fool us, resulting in annoyance 
on all sides.  We do check our addresses and do NOT send duplicates, nor 
do we fail to remove people who ask it from the list. We are NOT interested 
in angering people, as that is counter productive... Our objective is to serve 
and inform those who wish it, and to help coordinate responsible promotion 
of the advantages of the Linux Operating System.   
