Yes. Enlightenment DR-0.7 is now OUT!

What is Enlightenment? It is a Windowmanager for X. One of the few that
were written from scratch without being based on another windowmanager
(nearly every windowmanager is based on twm, and some on 9wm, including
Afterstep, Fvwm, Fvwm-95 etc.)

The Aims of Enlightenment are to be the best looking windowmanager ever
written, with the highest degree of configurability. It is cutrrently in
Development Release 7 stage, and is beginnig to get quite usable. For
more information take a look at:

http://www.cse.unsw.edu.au/~s2154962/enlightenment/

